y\">67-df-iterated-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Lemma 4.2(a),(b)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>54</span><span>55</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>65</span><span>66</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"source-statement-checked; proof scope and outstanding obligations in Remark"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为固定 PR 呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n(S)\">\\(C_n(S)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" href=\"?note=f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" title=\"67-df-iterated-consistency\">67-df-iterated-consistency</a> 的递归；对有限加句使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a> 的同一自然编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>；所有等价和蕴涵内是对象语言算术句，外层可证明性为元语言关系。</li>\n<li>右侧和左侧的全部迭代使用同一个种子公理公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_S\">\\(\\sigma_S\\)</span>。作为左侧外层迭代的输入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\cup\\{C_m(S)\\}\">\\(S\\cup\\{C_m(S)\\}\\)</span> 的种子精确取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{S;C_m(S)}\">\\(\\sigma_{S;C_m(S)}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" href=\"?note=f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" title=\"67-df-iterated-consistency\">67-df-iterated-consistency</a>；不把仅可证等价的公理公式视作句法相等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(k&gt;m\\to\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash(C_k(S)\\to C_m(S))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;(k&gt;m\\to\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash(C_k(S)\\to C_m(S))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\left(C_k(S\\cup\\{C_m(S)\\})\\leftrightarrow C_{k+m}(S)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\left(C_k(S\\cup\\{C_m(S)\\})\\leftrightarrow C_{k+m}(S)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条的原书页码及既往核对记录继承自输入档案；本轮未提供原书 PDF，这些记录不表示本轮重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书印刷54–55页/PDF65–66页引理2。第二式的基步 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=1\">\\(k=1\\)</span> 就是递归定义；归纳步用此前迭代蕴涵较低迭代以及单公理扩张的证明转换，将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+C_m(S)+C_{k+m}(S)\">\\(S+C_m(S)+C_{k+m}(S)\\)</span> 归约到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+C_{k+m}(S)\">\\(S+C_{k+m}(S)\\)</span>。第一式来自公理包含下的一致性单调性并对步数归纳。</p>\n<p>源书将证明留给读者。本轮核对了递归和该证明路线，未独立展开全部内部证明转换；不把这段路线标为已完成的独立形式证明。此条显式采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>，覆盖本册反思应用所需的基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-iterated-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"f9e2ecde3df48a4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-iterated-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-iterated-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"f9e2ecde3df48a4b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 为固定 PR 呈示，$C_n(S)$ 采用 [[67-df-iterated-consistency]] 的递归；对有限加句使用 [[67-df-formula-provability]] 的同一自然编码。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula-provability","status":"resolved","id":"1e05755479add015","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 为固定 PR 呈示，$C_n(S)$ 采用 [[67-df-iterated-consistency]] 的递归；对有限加句使用 [[67-df-formula-provability]] 的同一自然编码。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-iterated-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"f9e2ecde3df48a4b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"右侧和左侧的全部迭代使用同一个种子公理公式 $\\sigma_S$。作为左侧外层迭代的输入，$S\\cup\\{C_m(S)\\}$ 的种子精确取 $\\sigma_{S;C_m(S)}$，见 [[67-df-iterated-consistency]]；不把仅可证等价的公理公式视作句法相等。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"C_n(S)","display":false},{"tex":"k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_S","display":false},{"tex":"S\\cup\\{C_m(S)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{S;C_m(S)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;(k>m\\to\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash(C_k(S)\\to C_m(S))).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\left(C_k(S\\cup\\{C_m(S)\\})\\leftrightarrow C_{k+m}(S)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"k=1","display":false},{"tex":"S+C_m(S)+C_{k+m}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S+C_{k+m}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false}],"bytes":2726,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-consistency-iterate-laws]]"}],"outgoing":["f9e2ecde3df48a4b","cd051851df5d2aa2","1e05755479add015"]}